---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../utils/url";
import { LINKS } from "../../consts";
import "../../styles/pages/path.css";
---

<Page title="From the bench to the agents · Marc Recio" description="Marc Recio's path: food science, plant breeding in the lab, then data science and AI systems; his experience, studies and certificates." nav="path" footer="inner">
<main id="top">
  <section class="head head--plain" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container head__inner">
      <div>
        <a class="back" href={withBase("/")}><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to the landing</a>
        <p class="label"><span class="label__n">06</span>Experience</p>
        <h1 id="page-title" class="page-title">From the bench <span class="accent-word">to the agents</span>.</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">Curiosity has always moved me. A course on transgenic plants took me from food science to plant breeding, and wanting to bring programming and data analysis to genomics took me to data science. This time is different: in data science and AI engineering I found my fit and a real vocation, which is why I am working on so much at once, eager to find the right opportunity and grow as far as I can. Where I come from also feeds my creativity: I often find common patterns in how things work in very different areas.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="stages reveal"><svg viewBox="0 0 960 190" role="img" aria-label="From the bench to the agents: food science, plant breeding, Semillas Fitó, COMAV, data science, TomsBioLab" font-family="IBM Plex Sans, sans-serif"><defs><linearGradient id="pg" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="70" x2="890" y1="0" y2="0"><stop offset="0" data-pc="c-5f6f2a"/><stop offset=".55" data-pc="c-75621a"/><stop offset=".8" data-pc="c-336f7e"/><stop offset="1" data-pc="c-6b4a7a"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M70 96H890" stroke="url(#pg)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="70.0" cy="96" r="11" data-pf="c-ffffff" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="4"/><text x="70.0" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">2017–21</text><text x="70.0" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">Food science</text><text x="70.0" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">BSc · UPV</text><circle cx="234.0" cy="96" r="11" data-pf="c-ffffff" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="4"/><text x="234.0" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">2021–24</text><text x="234.0" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">Plant breeding</text><text x="234.0" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">MSc · UPV, COMAV</text><circle cx="398.0" cy="96" r="11" data-pf="c-ffffff" data-ps="c-75621a" stroke-width="4"/><text x="398.0" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">2023</text><text x="398.0" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">Semillas Fitó</text><text x="398.0" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">lab technician</text><circle cx="562.0" cy="96" r="11" data-pf="c-ffffff" data-ps="c-75621a" stroke-width="4"/><text x="562.0" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">2024</text><text x="562.0" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">COMAV</text><text x="562.0" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">research staff</text><circle cx="726.0" cy="96" r="11" data-pf="c-ffffff" data-ps="c-336f7e" stroke-width="4"/><text x="726.0" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">2025–</text><text x="726.0" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">Data science</text><text x="726.0" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">MSc · UOC</text><circle cx="890.0" cy="96" r="11" data-pf="c-ffffff" data-ps="c-6b4a7a" stroke-width="4"/><text x="890.0" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">2026–</text><text x="890.0" y="132" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">TomsBioLab</text><text x="890.0" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">thesis · AI systems</text><text x="70" y="24" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="12" letter-spacing="1.6" data-pf="c-5f6f2a">THE BENCH</text><text x="890" y="24" text-anchor="end" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="12" letter-spacing="1.6" data-pf="c-6b4a7a">THE AGENTS</text></svg></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blockp" aria-labelledby="jobs-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="--tone:var(--a-mustard)"><span class="label__n">3</span>Where I have worked</p>
      <h2 id="jobs-title" class="h2">What I did, and <span class="accent-word">what I took</span>.</h2>
      <ol class="jobs">
        <li class="jobx" id="tomsbiolab" style="--c:var(--a-plum)"><p class="jobx__when">2026 – present</p><div><h3 class="jobx__title">Internship, my master's thesis</h3><p class="jobx__org">TomsBioLab, I2SysBio (CSIC – Universitat de València)</p><ul><li>I build the thesis's pipeline: language models read the papers, tested code assigns the evidence level, a curator holds two gates.</li><li>For the gene catalogues of the PlantaeViz species.</li></ul><p class="jobx__took">That a model's output is only worth something once a scientist can audit it.</p></div></li>
        <li class="jobx" id="comav" style="--c:var(--a-teal)"><p class="jobx__when">May – Dec 2024</p><div><h3 class="jobx__title">Research staff</h3><p class="jobx__org">COMAV, Universitat Politècnica de València</p><ul><li>A protocol for obtaining transgenic rapeseed; in-vitro microspore cultures.</li><li>PCR and sequencing; histology of how salinity affects reproduction in <i>Cakile maritima</i>.</li><li>The statistical analyses behind the experiments.</li></ul><p class="jobx__took">Designing the statistics behind the experiments: where data first became the work.</p></div></li>
        <li class="jobx" id="fito" style="--c:var(--a-olive)"><p class="jobx__when">Jun – Nov 2023</p><div><h3 class="jobx__title">Laboratory technician, internship</h3><p class="jobx__org">Semillas Fitó, Cabrera de Mar, Barcelona</p><ul><li>In-vitro double haploids in pepper, cucumber and watermelon.</li><li>DNA-extraction protocols in the molecular-biology department.</li></ul><p class="jobx__took">A breeding company's lab, where a protocol is worth what it repeats.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blockp blockp--warm" id="studies" aria-labelledby="studies-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="--tone:var(--a-mustard)"><span class="label__n">3</span>Studies</p>
      <h2 id="studies-title" class="h2">What I have <span class="accent-word">studied</span>.</h2>
      <ol class="jobs">
        <li class="jobx" id="msc-ds" style="--c:var(--a-teal)"><p class="jobx__when">Feb 2025 – in progress</p><div><h3 class="jobx__title">MSc in Data Science</h3><p class="jobx__org">Universitat Oberta de Catalunya</p><ul><li>Machine learning, with the course's top grade; statistics, databases, data capture and visualization.</li><li>The thesis: <a href={withBase("/work/tfm/")}>human-in-the-loop gene curation</a>.</li></ul></div></li>
        <li class="jobx" id="msc-pb" style="--c:var(--a-olive)"><p class="jobx__when">Sep 2021 – Sep 2024</p><div><h3 class="jobx__title">MSc in Plant Genetic Breeding</h3><p class="jobx__org">Universitat Politècnica de València, COMAV</p><ul><li>The thesis, graded 10/10: <a href={withBase("/work/tfm-plant-breeding/")}>a chemical screen for heat-stressed pollen</a>.</li></ul></div></li>
        <li class="jobx" id="bsc" style="--c:var(--a-mustard)"><p class="jobx__when">Sep 2017 – Sep 2021</p><div><h3 class="jobx__title">BSc in Food Science &amp; Technology</h3><p class="jobx__org">Universitat Politècnica de València</p><ul><li>The thesis: <a href={withBase("/work/tfg-food-science/")}>essential oils of three citrus</a>.</li></ul></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blockp" aria-labelledby="certs-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="--tone:var(--a-mustard)"><span class="label__n">8</span>Certificates and languages</p>
      <h2 id="certs-title" class="h2">Also <span class="accent-word">on the way</span>.</h2>
      <div class="certs2">
        <ul>
          <li>CS50's Introduction to Programming with Python<span>HarvardX, edX</span></li>
          <li>Data Science: R Basics<span>HarvardX PH125.1x, edX</span></li>
          <li>Cambridge English: B2 First<span>Cambridge Assessment English</span></li>
          <li>Valencian, level C1<span>JQCV</span></li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Spanish<span>native</span></li>
          <li>Valencian (Catalan)<span>native</span></li>
          <li>English<span>fluent, B2 First</span></li>
          <li>French<span>A2</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Page>
